            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;This information is provided to assist in providing an at-a-glance view of the opportunity and its related records, such as its primary quote, the subscriptions (if any) connected to quote lines, the contract to which the subscriptions are connected, and the renewal opportunity on the contract.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunity Name&lt;/strong&gt;: {!Get_Opportunity.Name}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Primary Quote: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/{!Get_Opportunity.SBQQ__PrimaryQuote__c}&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;{!Get_Opportunity.SBQQ__PrimaryQuote__r.Name}&lt;/a&gt; (ID: {!Get_Opportunity.SBQQ__PrimaryQuote__c})&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subscriptions&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;{!text_Subscriptions}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a href=&quot;/{!Get_Contract.Id}&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;{!Get_Contract.ContractNumber}&lt;/a&gt; (ID: {!Get_Contract.Id})&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exit ARR on Contract&lt;/strong&gt;: ${!Get_Contract.Exit_ARR__c}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Renewal Oppty on Contract&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a href=&quot;/{!Get_Contract.SBQQ__RenewalOpportunity__c}&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;{!Get_Contract.SBQQ__RenewalOpportunity__r.Name}&lt;/a&gt; (ID: {!Get_Contract.SBQQ__RenewalOpportunity__c})&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
